      "content": "The high jitter observed in the traceroute results and the ping statistics suggest issues with network congestion or routing inefficiencies rather than purely physical-layer problems. The significant delay variations indicated by jitter are more likely to be caused by routing problems. Monitoring the situation further or analyzing routing paths might help pinpoint the exact cause.",
