      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i checked the physical interface on that second hop (172.16.5.1) and the light levels look okay, no CRC errors or anything like that on the SFP. but the spikes are so random, like they just pop in and out for a few seconds then disappear. could it be some kind of intermittent interference or something messing with the hardware itself? it's driving us crazy trying to find a pattern.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
